   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Member Salon: Ken Russell’s The Devils" href="/whats-on/member-salon-ken-russells-the-devils" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Member Salon: Ken Russell’s The Devils</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Join us to discuss the controversy, art and meaning of Ken Russell’s controversial drama.</p>
