   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Midnight" href="/whats-on/midnight" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Midnight</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>In another Leisen-Wilder classic, a showgirl faking wealth and status is drawn into a plot to break up a relationship.</p>
