 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Minotaur" href="/whats-on/minotaur" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Minotaur</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The acclaimed director of Leviathan, Elena and Loveless returns with an incisive, darkly entertaining adaptation of Claude Chabrol’s La Femme infidèle, which also plays as a stark critique of contemporary Russia.</p>
  </div>
