  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Pan’s Labyrinth" href="/whats-on/pans-labyrinth" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Pan’s Labyrinth</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>A deliciously dark fable that marries political conviction with compelling performances, this 20th-anniversary re-release of del Toro’s multi-award winner is the perfect synthesis of vividly realised storytelling and the very boldest of imaginations.</p>
