 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Passing" href="/whats-on/passing" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Passing</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Rebecca Hall’s stylish directorial debut explores the life of a Black woman whose world is intertwined with a childhood friend now passing as white.</p>
  </div>
