 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="The Private Life of Sherlock Holmes" href="/whats-on/the-private-life-of-sherlock-holmes" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The Private Life of Sherlock Holmes</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Billy Wilder’s fresh perspective on our most famous detective led to interference and backlash but remains a beautifully humane mystery.</p>
  </div>
