   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Revisiting Ealing Studios" href="/whats-on/revisiting-ealing-studios" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Revisiting Ealing Studios<span data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf> - UEA Film50</span></a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>From the BFI’s pioneering UEA lectureship to a landmark publication, Charles Barr’s influence on Film Studies endures.</p>
